n"},"interpretation_note":"保存本段明示子、生育、母稱與兄弟來源主張；不把繼位獨自作父子，不補未知母名或同父同母。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"a-shiji042-005","subject_person_id":"muq_yy8_8er","predicate":"mother","object_person_id":"06i_k5v_922_A","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-042-zheng","source_id":"s-shiji-042-zheng","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:p003","quote":"武公十年，娶申侯女爲夫人，曰武姜。生太子寤生，生之難，及生，夫人弗愛。後生少子叔段，段生易，夫人愛之。二十七年，武公疾。夫人請公，欲立段爲太子，公弗聽。是歳，武公卒，寤生立，是爲莊公。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"曰武姜。生太子寤生","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"保存本段明示子、生育、母稱與兄弟來源主張；不把繼位獨自作父子，不補未知母名或同父同母。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"a-shiji042-006","subject_person_id":"dlo_vgs_o6c","predicate":"mother","object_person_id":"06i_k5v_922_A","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-042-zheng","source_id":"s-shiji-042-zheng","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:p003","quote":"武公十年，娶申侯女爲夫人，曰武姜。生太子寤生，生之難，及生，夫人弗愛。後生少子叔段，段生易，夫人愛之。二十七年，武公疾。夫人請公，欲立段爲太子，公弗聽。是歳，武公卒，寤生立，是爲莊公。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"後生少子叔段","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"保存本段明示子、生育、母稱與兄弟來源主張；不把繼位獨自作父子，不補未知母名或同父同母。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji042-019","person_id":"06i_k5v_922_A","surfaces":["夫人","武姜"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-042-zheng"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:p003","quote":"武公十年，娶申侯女爲夫人，曰武姜。生太子寤生，生之難，及生，夫人弗愛。後生少子叔段，段生易，夫人愛之。二十七年，武公疾。夫人請公，欲立段爲太子，公弗聽。是歳，武公卒，寤生立，是爲莊公。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:p004","quote":"莊公元年，封弟段於京，號太叔。祭仲曰：「京大於國，非所以封庶也。」莊公曰：「武姜欲之，我弗敢奪也。」段至京，繕治甲兵，與其母武姜謀襲鄭。二十二年，段果襲鄭，武姜爲内應。莊公發兵伐段，段走。伐京，京人畔段，段出走鄢。鄢潰，段出奔共。於是莊公遷其母武姜於城潁，誓言曰：「不至黃泉，毋相見也。」居歳餘，已悔思母。潁谷之考叔有獻於公，公賜食。考叔曰：「臣有母，請君食賜臣母。」莊公曰：「我甚思母，惡負盟，柰何？」考叔曰：「穿地至黃泉，則相見矣。」於是遂從之，見母。"}],"rationale":"依本篇名字、是為、世系及連續事件暫接異稱；同諡不同國分開，建子勝與聲公勝不合併，如兄弟為譬喻不作親屬。述贊與正文不算獨立來源，省稱、古字與校勘仍待核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:p003","text":"武公十年，娶申侯女爲夫人，曰武姜。生太子寤生，生之難，及生，夫人弗愛。後生少子叔段，段生易，夫人愛之。二十七年，武公疾。夫人請公，欲立段爲太子，公弗聽。是歳，武公卒，寤生立，是爲莊公。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m003-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"武公","kind":"person","person_id":"mgh_3bh_rit_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m003-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"申侯","kind":"person","person_id":"06i_k5v_922","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m003-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"夫人","kind":"person","person_id":"06i_k5v_922_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m003-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"武姜","kind":"person","person_id":"06i_k5v_922_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m003-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"太子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名、群體、泛稱或指代待核；不補姓名、成員或親屬關係。"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m003-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"寤生","kind":"person","person_id":"muq_yy8_8er","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m003-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"夫人","kind":"person","person_id":"06i_k5v_922_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m003-0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"叔段","kind":"person","person_id":"dlo_vgs_o6c","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m003-0042","start":42,"end":43,"surface":"段","kind":"person","person_id":"dlo_vgs_o6c","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m003-0046","start":46,"end":48,"surface":"夫人","kind":"person","person_id":"06i_k5v_922_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m003-0056","start":56,"end":58,"surface":"武公","kind":"person","person_id":"mgh_3bh_rit_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m0